    "body": "[`crush` documentation](https://github.com/liljencrantz/crush/blob/master/docs/overview.md#calling-external-commands) says:\n> But Crush does not hand over the tty or emulate a tty, so interactive terminal programs do not work, and commands that prettify their output with escape sequences may fail.\n\nI haven't verified it but I guess that means supporting starship might be impossible due to lack of support for escape sequences which are used for prompt formatting.",
